      "No key eviction or initializer/map lock spans recursive load. Slot publication, duplicate miss handling, poisoned-map error behavior and immutable ownership are unchanged.",
      "Cache allocation size and per-view prefix remain unchanged. Any improvement must come from lookup cost/collision distribution; no intermediate-state or feature-work reduction is claimed.",
      "Added full-window tests check exact values, unique slots and rereads over positive/negative/near-i32-limit windows. Existing tests exercise fallback, recursion, errors, concurrent loads and drop lifetime."
    ],
